Package: DTAtools
Title: Validation and Authoring Tools for Data Transfer Agreements (DTAs) and Data Transmission Specifications (DTS)
Version: 0.24.0
Authors@R: c(
	person("Thomas", "Schwarzl", email = "thomas.schwarzl@boehringer-ingelheim.com",
		role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7697-7000")),
	person("Daniel", "Schreyer",
		email = "daniel.schreyer.ext@boehringer-ingelheim.com", role = c("aut", "ctb")))
Maintainer: Thomas Schwarzl <thomas.schwarzl@boehringer-ingelheim.com>
Description: Tools for defining, validating, and processing data transfer
	agreements (DTAs) and data transfer specifications (DTS). The package supports
	importing, checking, transforming, and exporting structured data while
	ensuring compliance with predefined contract and specification rules. It is
	designed for reproducible data workflows and integrates with common R-based
	analysis pipelines for metadata handling, data validation, and reporting.
